        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.fmowners.com/"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Year‑round weather stays mild, with winter temperatures ranging from the mid‑30s to 60s and summer highs in the 70s to upper 90s.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.fmowners.com/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The area receives about 42 inches of rain annually and roughly 20 inches of snowfall each year.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        17
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.fmowners.com/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Nestled in the Sierra Nevada foothills, Forest Meadows is close to Stanislaus National Forest, where residents enjoy hiking, camping, and fishing.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        18,
        19
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.trawellino.com/destinations/united-states/california_forest-meadows"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The community hosts nearly 600 homes, making it a tight‑knit residential enclave in Calaveras County.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
